# Pi agent config: track ONLY settings.json.
# Everything else here holds secrets, API keys, LAN endpoints, session
# transcripts, and package caches — never commit any of it.
#
#   auth.json          -> provider API keys (sk-ant-..., /login tokens)
#   mcp.json           -> MCP server env, e.g. real Forgejo/Woodpecker tokens
#   models.json        -> local model providers with LAN IPs
#   models-store.json  -> model cache
#   mcp-cache.json     -> discovered tool cache
#   mcp-onboarding.json-> onboarding state
#   run-history.jsonl  -> subagent run log
#   sessions/          -> full session transcripts
#   npm/               -> installed pi packages + node_modules
#   bin/               -> pi package binaries
#   trust.json         -> per-project trust decisions

*
!settings.json
!.gitignore
